+        # so the values are identical and only the sign bit of exact zeros can differ.
+        # AK_X7_SKIP_GRAD_ZERO=1 arms it; the padding between parameters is never read.
+        # (sec 168: ported to the 20260929 image; 0929's reset() is the 0828 body, and
